flowchart TB
    Director[director pods] -->|mail ports / NetworkPolicy| Service[Service imap]
    subgraph Namespace[namespace imap]
        Service --> A[mail server pod A]
        Service --> B[mail server pod B]
        Scrub[scrub CronJob]
